{{Codex|This scoped pistol analyzes strikes, learning how to damage its targets most effectively. Achieve maximum damage output after five successive hits.}}
The '''Arca Scisco''' is a {{Faction|Corpus}}-built [[Zoom|scoped]] laser pistol that gains a stacking [[critical chance]] and [[status chance]] buff on every shot.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*Shots trigger '''Target Analysis''' buff, increasing [[critical chance]] and [[status chance]] by '''4%''' flat, stacking up to five times for '''20%''', and lasts '''2''' seconds. Buff can be refreshed on consecutive shots.
*Has 2x and 4x zoom options when zooming in with the weapon.

{{Advantages|
*Second highest magazine size of all semi-auto pistols, behind {{Weapon|Akbolto Prime}}.
}}

{{Disadvantages|}}

==Acquisition==
The Arca Scisco's blueprint can be [[research]]ed from the [[Research/Energy Lab|Energy Lab]] in the [[dojo]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==
*When a shot hits an enemy, the Arca Scisco gets the '''Target Analysis''' buff. A flat '''4%''' [[critical chance]] and [[status chance]] bonus are added ''after'' mods, stacking up to five times on shots up to '''20%'''. The buff lasts for '''2''' seconds and can be refreshed. When the buff times out, one stack is lost and the buff duration resets.
*Secondary sniper rifle, very useful if you happen to use a short range weapon like a shotgun as a primary.
*Fire rate is capped at 10 Shots/Sec due to the Semi-Auto trigger type.

==Trivia==
*The writing on the side of the weapon seems to translate as "LONG BOLTER".

